  "body": "## Bathcat intake-gap report\n\n- Stable intake slug: `elder-sign`\n- BGG ID: `100423`\n- Cohort attempted: `cooperative`\n- Scope: released physical base game; exact printing not frozen because governing rules evidence was not retrievable.\n\n### Shortfall\nThe candidate did not meet `ready_for_audit`. The official core rulebook was not retrieved from an official endpoint, so the bounded governing-document inventory cannot be closed. No packet or canonical tree was created. Independent reception and meaningful visual receipts were not completed after the primary-rules gate failed.\n\n### Attempted sources and outcomes\n- Wishlist lead: `WISHLIST.md`, Elder Sign rules + reception.\n- Identity lead: https://boardgamegeek.com/boardgame/100423/elder-sign \u2014 discovery only; not used as official rules evidence.\n- Official publisher product page: https://www.fantasyflightgames.com/en/products/elder-sign/ \u2014 direct retrieval returned HTTP 403 (`text/html`, 5,486 bytes); no rulebook file was acquired.\n- Candidate rulebook CDN guess: https://images-cdn.fantasyflightgames.com/filer_public/0f/4f/0f4f0f/elder_sign_rules.pdf \u2014 HTTP 403; URL did not yield a usable receipt.\n\n### Help requested\nProvide an official or authorized exact-edition core rulebook URL and confirm the printing. After that, retrieve an independent review outside Fantasy Flight Games and BGG plus at least two meaningful source-linked visuals from permitted sources.\n\nThis is a research gap, not an infrastructure failure.",
